  "hero_summary_zh": "召唤成波深渊之焰，焚祭在恶意掌控中无力还手的敌人。战斗的屠戮是场盛宴，敌人的消亡将会带来力量，他们的攻势在你面前不值一提。在现实中撕出一道裂隙，将自己和友军全屏传送，胆敢蔑视孽主意志的人，维洛格罗斯将奉上血腥的报应。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Conjure waves of abyssal flame to immolate enemies held paralyzed in your spiteful grip. Feast upon the carnage of battle, gaining strength as foes perish around you, their attacks diminished by your very presence. Tear a rift in reality to teleport yourself and your teammates across the map, delivering bloody retribution to any who would defy the will of Vrogros the Underlord.",
